OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with outbreaks   
OL,6,Fof heavy rain and hill snow. Rain      
OL,7,Feasing and becoming confined to the    
OL,8,Fwest through the morning. Becoming dry 
OL,9,Ffor all parts in the afternoon with    
OL,10,Fsome brighter intervals possible over  
OL,11,FCentral areas.                         
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be a dry night with   
OL,14,Fclear spells. Cloudier and breezier    
OL,15,Fover western Argyll, while elsewhere   
OL,16,Fit will be cold with frost forming.    
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
